{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, isolating its impact compared to pca_n2000 (config_004). Validation accuracy of 0.6315 suggests potential performance benefits from the RNA encoder choice, though the slightly lower F1 (0.6068) compared to config_004 (0.6103) indicates uncertainty about its overall impact. The role of fusion or aggregation strategies remains untested in this comparison."
}

